  "history": "Only previously registered own training tapes. Physical seat in the native comparator tickets is the historical expert seat. Reconstruct the official referee, both public beliefs and issued intents before root; verify source tape, recreated terrain, action SHA and full-trajectory cash-path SHA. Reconstruct candidate and opponent streams, never claim original private entropy. Use the registered policy_rng as root initialization for V2 as in the comparator. Opposite original RNG is an independent seeded paired draw. Actual original opponent issues a common root reply before it can see either candidate order. V2 first and alternative interventions use exactly the published stable physical orders; both then follow the same V2 and untouched original public agent T1 and 0.58 s to official terminal. Update own belief with committed root action each arm. Dataset registration excludes dev1, future formal and unrelated roots.",
  "registration": "Apply the search protocol in fixed work order. Count every late root and the reason for exclusion. Accept up to the first four with the same parent/candidate original menu, depths, primary value work, and internally completed re-scoring in both repeated candidate calls. Repeated parent actions must match, repeated candidate actions must match and must differ from parent. If the registered global gate closes because eligible native work exceeded the deadline or no change survived, stop. Never rank by terminal result or add replacement maps.",
  "schema": "native-dual-critic-terminal-pairs/1",
  "scores": "Restore official referee bank and state and both models after the common root requests. Record root and suffix actual calls, CPU and public wall time, K/H/rolls and deadline, full per-seat order paths. Report official scores, win and margin as candidate seat, and net cash and normal deliveries, hiring, tree revenues and collision cash each arm in first 10 steps or earlier terminal, plus final differential. Old exposed training positions, one paired RNG stream per root, so diagnostic only. Arithmetic uses both arms including either loss. A held final match remains separate.",
